  "randomTables" : [ {
    "name" : "Bestiary",
    "items" : "Goblin | 6 | 7 | Ropy skin -d2 | Knife/shortbow d4 | Quick: attacks and defence against it are DR14. Its curse: kill it within d6 days of its attack or become a goblin. | Head 7s, captured 150s, dead 20s\nScum | 7 | 8 | No armor | Poisoned knife d4 | Poisoned knife: Toughness DR10 or infected. The PC with the highest Presence tests DR14 at the start of battle, or a random PC is backstabbed for normal damage +3. | Captured 50–120s, dead 20–70s (wanted)\nBerserker | 13 | 9 | Hardened skin -d2 | Long flail d8, heavy mace d6, chained sword d6 or huge warhammer d10 | Attacks twice per round but doesn't defend (DR10 to hit). | Dead 20s, captured 55s, blood 3s per litre\nWraith | 15 | – | No armor | Touch d4 | Swift, elusive and hard to hit (DR14); always wins initiative. Its touch drains Strength, Presence and Agility by 1 for the fight. | Captured 120s, skull 70s, ectoplasm 25s\nBlood-drenched skeleton | 7 | 8 | No armor | Shortsword d4, knife d4 or bony knuckles d2 | Soundless, attacks by surprise and mimics voices it has heard. Piercing weapons hit on DR14; 5 or more damage destroys it. | Captured 35s, destroyed 7s\nUndead necromancer | 15 | – | Barrier (necro) -d4 | Strike d6 | Paralyzing touch: Presence DR14 every round to break free. No one can use Powers near it; each round it can steal a nearby scroll's Power and use it against its owner. | Captured 200s, remains 130s, skull 100s\nTroll | 32 | special | Thick hide -d2 | Fist 2d6 | Easy to hit (DR10). Cowardly: retreats when badly wounded, heals into a larger troll and returns with +d6 damage, never forgetting who hurt it. | Captured 200s, corpse 70s, horn 25s\nZombie | 7 | – | Leather scraps -d2 | Claw/bite d2 | Anyone bitten tests Toughness DR8 or dies within two days and rises as a zombie. | Captured 30s, blood 5s per litre\nUndead doll | 11 | – | Porcelain -d2 | Claws/piercing bite d4 | Mad gaze: Presence DR12 at the start of combat or frozen with fear for d4 rounds. | Head 20s, captured 80s\nGrotesque | 18 | – | Clay/stone -d6 | Claws d6 or eye-beam d8 | Slow and easy to hit (DR10). Its terrifying gaze is used on 1–2 on d6 each round and always hits. | Captured 190s, dead (intact) 100s, dead (in pieces) 10s\nWickhead knife-wielder | 10 | 7 | No armor | Knife with dried blood d4 | Sneaks up silent as the grave; 25% chance its wounds become infected. Can douse nearby lights, ignite its own blinding light, attack and vanish. | Captured 60s, decapitated lantern 15s, corpse 20s\nWyvern | 25 | 10 | Thick hide -d4 | Bite/sting d6 | 60% chance she bites. Venomous sting: Toughness DR14 or paralyzed for one painful hour. Where the wyvern fly, crops die. | Captured 200s, corpse 100s, poison gland 60s, tail spike 60s",
